  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Falguni Sanjay Nayar (née Mehta; born 1963) is an Indian billionaire businesswoman, who is the founder and CEO of the beauty and lifestyle retail company Nykaa, formally known as FSN E-Commerce Ventures which is an acronym of her own name.\nAs per Forbes list of India’s 100 richest tycoons, dated October 09, 2024, Falguni Nayar & family was ranked 71st with a net worth of $4.2 Billion.\n\n",
    "sourceId": "wikipedia-en",
